class TetraCube5:
"""
Dual-layer 5x5x5 compact cube:
Layer 1 (data): Physics / Lossless Residual footprint (500 bytes)
Layer 2 (semantic): System telemetry & deterministic state evaluations (500 bytes)
Total Monolithic Quantum Payload: 1000 bytes.
